>AIGC人工智能</category></item><item><title>情绪稳定并不是压抑情绪</title><description>情绪稳定并不是压抑情绪&lt;br&gt;情绪稳定并不是压抑你的情绪，而是以非破坏性的方式表达你的情绪。&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/acac3498ff73c3e0aab42655e4e476861a51d071.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;视频地址：&lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VdZLBVE5h"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VdZLBVE5h&lt;/a&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VdZLBVE5h</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VdZLBVE5h</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 10:00:04 GMT</pubDate><author>心理学韩卓</author><category>情绪疗愈指南</category></item></channel></rss>